    "summary": "Use it in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), right after an enemy unit picks its targets. Pick 1 **ADEPTUS MECHANICUS** unit of yours (not a **VEHICLE**) that is a target of at least 1 of those attacks. If it is **BATTLELINE**, you may also pick 1 **SKITARII** unit of yours within 6\" of it that is not **BATTLELINE**.\n\nUntil the phase ends, attacks that target a picked unit get -1 to **[Wound rolls](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls)**.",
